            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Young or unwise space goblins are distressingly easy to convince to join in theft or violence. Just as quick to jump into a fight as they are to run away when things go wrong, these little miscreants plague any outsiders foolish enough to travel Absalom Station's rough neighborhoods.</p><h2>Space Goblins</h2><p>Goblins are relatively common throughout Absalom Station. Their love of cramped, dark places makes the back alleys and pipelines of the station exceptionally appealing to them. Many goblins are content to live among the populace as merchants, artisans, and cartoonists (with a growing number of goblin publishing houses producing wordless and individualistic \"gobbo-comix\"), but other goblins have a tendency to make trouble. Some of these tricky troublemakers cause blackouts, fires, and even-greater problems throughout Absalom Station.</p>",
